---
import '../../styles/components/index/experts.css';
---
<section>
    <div id="experts">
        <div class="bg">
            <div class="inBox">
                <div class="flex justify-between">
                    <div class="titleBox">
                        <div class="itemTitle">
                            <p>專家觀點</p>
                            <p>EXPERTS</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="list">
                        <div class="item">
                            <div class="img">
                                <img width="400" height="400" src="/expert01.jpg" alt="expert" loading="lazy" />
                            </div>
                            <div class="txtBox">
                                <div class="name">
                                    Richard Brown
                                </div>
                                <div class="tag">
                                    <a href="#">產業評論者</a>
                                    <a href="#">外資視角</a>
                                </div>
                                <div class="description">
                                    以外資與國際資本視角，剖析台灣科技產業在全球供應鏈中的位置，為外資企業與跨國決策者提供第一手洞察。
                                </div>
                                <div class="intro">
                                    <a href="#">
                                        <span>AVC and Auras Lead Taiwan’s AI Thermal Surge</span>
                                        <div class="arraw">
                                            <img width="28" height="28" src="/arraw-right-03.svg" alt="arraw" />
                                        </div>
                                    </a>
                                    <a href="#">
                                        <span>Taiwan’s AI Server Makers Extend Record Run in May</span>
                                        <div class="arraw">
                                            <img width="28" height="28" src="/arraw-right-03.svg" alt="arraw" />
                                        </div>
                                    </a>
                                    <a href="#">
                                        <span>Computex 2026: The Move to Optical Gathers Speed</span>
                                        <div class="arraw">
                                            <img width="28" height="28" src="/arraw-right-03.svg" alt="arraw" />
                                        </div>
                                    </a>
                                </div>

                                <div class="more">
                                    <a href="#">
                                        <span>完整介紹與觀點</span>
                                        <div class="arraw">
                                            <img width="28" height="28" src="/arraw-right-03.svg" alt="arraw" />
                                        </div>
                                    </a>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="item">
                            <div class="img">
                                <img width="400" height="400" src="/expert02.jpg" alt="expert" loading="lazy" />
                            </div>
                            <div class="txtBox">
                                <div class="name">
                                    Dimitri Bruyas
                                </div>
                                <div class="tag">
                                    <a href="#">英語新聞組組長</a>
                                    <a href="#">前《英文中國郵報》總編輯</a>
                                </div>
                                <div class="description">
                                    在台深耕媒體超過 20 年，擅長融合國際新聞觀點，以全英語、全方位角度報導台灣科技與半導體產業脈動，為海外決策者提供深度台灣視角。
                                </div>
                                <div class="intro">
                                    <a href="#">
                                        <span>AVC and Auras Lead Taiwan’s AI Thermal Surge</span>
                                        <div class="arraw">
                                            <img width="28" height="28" src="/arraw-right-03.svg" alt="arraw" />
